<title>USA: VIMRX names McIntosh CFO.</title>
<headline>VIMRX names McIntosh CFO.</headline>
<dateline>WILMINGTON, Del. 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>VIMRX Pharmaceuticals Inc said Wednesday that it has named L. William McIntosh senior vice president of business development and finance, and chief financial officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>McIntosh was most recently an independent consultant to pharmaceutical and biotechnology companies where he focused on strategic and business planning, marketing, advertising, sales and business development.</p>
<p>He succeeds Francis O'Connell, who has been appointed Vice President and Controller. O'Connell will also continue as chief financial officer of Innovir Laboratories, a majority owned VIMRX affiliate.</p>
</text>
